{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "12388ff4b142cbbad4eccb777e5aa3ee6f2cc0680131f47af8200f13e27ce5fe", "ja": "かもん、まいめん！", "zh": "Come on，my men！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "440c37604c6bd0c7b1b2e81abe1131ca2786a67a10b0bad7824015bc702148bc", "ja": "天体公演で新ユニット『アリエス』を組む事\nになった茜、星梨花、環。テレビ番組の企画\nで、ある高校の卒業式でサプライズライブを\nする事も決まり、張り切る3人！", "zh": "茜、星梨花和环决定在天体公演中组成新\n组合“白羊座”。由于还定下了要在电视\n节目的企划中，去某所高中的毕业典礼上\n举办惊喜Live，3个人都干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "a25a19ba38d4e4ef03238dbb4a700a368ec0af76143b177bbecfe5e65e365da3", "ja": "くふふ！　新しいお仕事の話だって♪　楽しみ～！\n今度はどんなことするのかな～？", "zh": "咯呼呼！听说是新的工作♪ 好期待啊～！\n这次要做什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "57be458f5c4e766cf47338e0fcdf3e46df3bb539ce09f35c372d5aeae0b7fc6a", "ja": "天体公演って聞きましたけど、\nそれだけじゃないって……うーん、なんでしょう？", "zh": "说是天体公演，\n但好像不仅如此……唔，会是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "c4bebb3120d28f4024f94f1952d7ca3b40166df98c53a5a03d22394cb5e9afc6", "ja": "ん～、環ちゃんと星梨花ちゃん、\nそして、この茜ちゃんに共通することと言えば……？", "zh": "嗯～，要说环、小星梨花和这个小茜的共同点，那就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "c0a257d6dbeaa47ab90460012d83586ec33ae5c071e6ef682df6a41f118afc1a", "ja": "明るく元気で、とってもカワイイもの同士って\nところだよね♪　お仕事も、それに関係すると見た！", "zh": "都是开朗活泼、特别可爱的孩子这一点吧♪ 我看这次的工作也和这个有关！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "9699052482c4195a33b6dcb3c910f192b46d94141b49d26b51b826c5da3b9b92", "ja": "えっ、それって……つまり、どういうことですか？", "zh": "诶，那就是说……究竟是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "19d16873ab02bcf29ce84e1ab3a69993e76d380d41780293e66cd5a3904ae8ef", "ja": "うん、具体的には、何もわからないけどネ！\nフィーリングだよ、フィーリング。", "zh": "嗯，具体是怎样我也完全搞不懂就是了！\n全凭感觉啦，感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "c7d3ed0b5c3b7d5956b8762db59ccea107e65e5b2b00377e21db0ced71b999c3", "ja": "たまき、天体公演だけでも嬉しいぞ！\nあかねとせりかと歌ったら、絶対楽しいもんね♪", "zh": "环，光是天体公演就很开心啦！\n要是能和茜、星梨花一起唱歌，肯定会很开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "dbecba8c4f3e6b969c8534424fcb382973ad96215ac00364ef1badcf215dd778", "ja": "えへへ、そうですよね♪\nユニットで何かするんでしょうか？", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊♪\n是要以组合的形式做些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "3305e2075cf9220d3953449bbab51a275d5dd8715a018ffac825c2bf8831066e", "ja": "まあ普通に考えたら、天体公演と連動した、\n何かのイベントとかだろうけど……ハッ！？　商機！", "zh": "要是按常理来想，应该会是和天体公演联动的\n什么活动之类的吧……哈！？商机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "b3f134179f3fc12a80be58e4771ab3eeecda53b1c59333a10118c95fdd357fe7", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、環ちゃんのグッズと抱き合わせで、\n茜ちゃん人形を……ブツブツ……！", "zh": "星梨花、和环的周边捆绑销售，再把小茜玩偶……嘀嘀咕咕……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "528ff1c18e07eec9f210cf21da1727f1f7ad1befc90dd6925ba1c1f7fc1ec878", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ。茜はまた何か企んでたのか？", "zh": "大家，久等了。茜又在打什么鬼主意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "58abd2c47885c2a4936ff8cb4a2341dee9aa4431b0d7488d13ba586dc287a1f3", "ja": "ギニャッ！？　まず疑ってかかる……\nそういう態度は、茜ちゃんよくないと思うナ～！", "zh": "吓！？一上来就先怀疑人……\n我觉得这种态度对小茜不太好吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b61513e2b01b5a3c10225e4c2db86a036359c5936b12d42a6f79eb9a44f7a649", "ja": "ごめんごめん、なんかブツブツ言ってたから……。", "zh": "对不起对不起，因为你刚才好像一直在嘀咕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "859e9590b5856c949772d7318069d3d4f3b36c83c5cb87a1b13ed5a7f25e2920", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n今ちょうど、新しいお仕事のことを話してたんです。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n我们刚好正在聊新工作的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "df078bb8eabb7e28254349dbae3c16335d92d6a9aad23f62f4f989f588c38b07", "ja": "早く教えてよ、おやぶん～！", "zh": "快点告诉我嘛，头儿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "707b1ebd602d73809a6da1e5cd86a537bb95b0e0493baeab599f4ced8ddc9dcc", "ja": "ああ、まず……3人にはユニット『アリエス』として、\n天体公演をやってもらう。これが新曲だ……っと。", "zh": "啊，首先……要让3人以组合『アリエス』的身份，进行天体公演。这就是新歌……好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_1017", "source_sha256": "3022c07c4bc42f33e616d1000be8f9136e0adca6dcdf281b67189cd2ee361464", "ja": "再生ボタンを押す", "zh": "按下播放按钮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0b6b575ceff6b3d51d5fd2d084288110c07b218e6db094265b6460613327cbad", "ja": "おお……！　\n茜ちゃんたちにピッタリの、ポップな曲だね！", "zh": "哦哦……！\n这是一首非常适合小茜她们的轻快歌曲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2002_p", "source_sha256": "adc5bb377f110f1306ad95a96871b27c49f628c6683d7a8df50082b2802614fe", "ja": "ああ。ちなみに歌詞はラップ調になる予定だ。\n少し難しいけど、歌えたら絶対楽しいと思うぞ！", "zh": "是的。顺带一提，歌词预计会采用说唱风格。\n虽然有点难，但要是能唱出来，肯定会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "7eb7854cbb77569f5bbae3eb678fca71829d0be3d768e5a4d694e959adeb51b7", "ja": "ラップ？　それって、\n前にりつこたちがやってたやつだよね？　すごい！", "zh": "说唱？那就是律子她们之前表演过的那个吧？好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2004_022ser", "source_sha256": "3bd5c2e1a9f95b9e63bc32823107045c32b45f08f8e34a338de9fe5b9532fd47", "ja": "『ARMooo』の公演、盛り上がってましたね♪\nわたしたちでラップなんて、とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "『ARMooo』的公演气氛真热烈呢♪\n要由我们来唱rap，真是令人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2005_p", "source_sha256": "8a571bbd7a56da2897ad1644b04a8cbe3f86b2c8796becec52c290b80afab49c", "ja": "こっちも楽しみだよ。フリースタイルパートも\nあるから、自由にやってみてくれ！", "zh": "这边也很期待哦。还有自由发挥环节，你们就尽情试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2006_040tam", "source_sha256": "56b11b45e23ab9911d78d50937ec052fe65f7461dfabff5c4f45eee4ffa0a267", "ja": "くふふ、すっごく楽しそうだぞ♪　\nあかね、せりか、一緒にレッスンがんばろうねっ♪", "zh": "咕呼呼，感觉超有意思的♪  \n茜、星梨花，我们一起努力上课吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2007_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2008_023aka", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "69a8b6ce43236c9b01048770edea5534349d1700ddc54d16039e042f712b59be", "ja": "それじゃ、天体公演はそれでお願いするとして……。\nもうひとつ、仕事の話。", "zh": "那么，天体公演就按这个来吧……\n还有一件事，是工作的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2010_022ser", "source_sha256": "063929fd45b6c805086bfe2a5b571f61837778dc6b7de1a58022fd1d7b068b67", "ja": "あ、そのお話、とっても楽しみにしてました！\nどんな内容なんですか？", "zh": "啊，我一直很期待您说的这件事！\n具体是什么内容呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2011_p", "source_sha256": "81f5485827c29ec13c4aa146bfa0a7cba65367a0c58442c49ca1954b52d57c8a", "ja": "うん、学校をテーマにしたテレビ番組のオファーで、\nある学校の卒業式に出てほしいそうなんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是一档以学校为主题的电视节目发来的通告，\n希望你能参加某所学校的毕业典礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2012_040tam", "source_sha256": "c32031e1a7685c1be6cd12813cca99eb7b2580c2038bf2be296643ea4101c83d", "ja": "卒業式？　たまき、まだ卒業はしないけど……？", "zh": "毕业典礼？环，还没到毕业的时候呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2013_p", "source_sha256": "a897bc2e55ac817ad6b56fcac45e77534b2972b5c3649a3dca5aeadb1b072d98", "ja": "いや、高校だからな。卒業生としてじゃないんだ。\nサプライズライブをしてほしいらしい。", "zh": "不是，因为那是高中。不是以毕业生的身份参加。他们似乎是想请我们办一场惊喜演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2014_p", "source_sha256": "daf4c469bc3167e1691b2a6b5dc6374d9b86cf678e59cd33daa387f49199f265", "ja": "その高校の生徒さんから、\n依頼のメールを預かってるから、読んでみてくれ。", "zh": "我收到了那所高中的学生发来的委托邮件，你读一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2015_023aka", "source_sha256": "59aa94994d336f663416b9ef464a2a3cb1ceec9d4533a6a0f189a350d9db9ddf", "ja": "どれどれ？　ええと……", "zh": "我看看？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2016_null", "source_sha256": "b17511992cc6c04b94c766b6e488389f98394b8cb3a3b4150590c46db24577ec", "ja": "ガサガサ……", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2017_023aka", "source_sha256": "8b353323d37c131da83f822547c7e948e237228dc512e81797620ee3927859e2", "ja": "「……卒業していく先輩たちに、私たち在校生から、\n明るくて楽しい思い出をプレゼントしたいんです！」", "zh": "“……我们这些在校生，想为即将毕业的\n学长学姐们送上一份充满欢笑的美好回忆！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2018_023aka", "source_sha256": "e6e4ba503f1e779b6529491b1650901992c28b5468796f1417ad0f34789526b9", "ja": "「忘れられないようなサプライズにするため、\n力を貸してください！」……ほほう、なるほど！", "zh": "“为了准备一个令人难忘的惊喜，\n请助我们一臂之力吧！”……哼哼，原来如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2019_022ser", "source_sha256": "e941336290e7e250dd029a5d028e6aa786783480f7b8efb004ca835aab6b8858", "ja": "わぁ、いいですね♪　わたしは小学校の\n卒業式って、やっぱり寂しい気持ちが大きくて……。", "zh": "哇，真不错♪　我小学毕业典礼的时候，果然还是觉得寂寞更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2020_022ser", "source_sha256": "f172963d7cadeec8dc01a6ca0417bed1e82e9ea36d0ade08c0a707aa04ec9195", "ja": "明るくて楽しい卒業式って、素敵だと思います！\nきっと、一生の思い出に残りますね♪", "zh": "我觉得开朗又开心的毕业典礼很棒！一定会成为一生难忘的回忆吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2021_040tam", "source_sha256": "e80c5ad5ef40c783b41a033fffe42f59f1e4db5d2ed379f93695973955f85ae6", "ja": "そうだよね！　ニコニコの思い出が残ったら、\nみんな嬉しい気持ちになれるよね。", "zh": "对呀！如果能留下满是笑容的回忆，大家一定都会感到开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2022_023aka", "source_sha256": "4dff0bce9fcbdadca70d63a895bb075f295881f3ab4105b6f51fdda32f820cdf", "ja": "ふっふっふ……サプライズとか、得意中の得意！\nこれは茜ちゃんにピッタリの案件です。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……惊喜什么的，可是我最拿手的！\n这正是最适合小茜的任务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2023_023aka", "source_sha256": "fbab6792819c7bccbc50f93dc4cd7f12577c6057db08995f7e8f46de1f50768b", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、任せて！\n最高の思い出、作っちゃうゾ☆　ニャハハーッ！", "zh": "{$P$}，就包在我身上吧！\n茜要创造最棒的回忆哦☆　喵哈哈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_01_2024_p", "source_sha256": "fbbdd10c48415960f5e0490b904a4a1ab32c05286b0e1be871a375fb4235d351", "ja": "（なんだかノリノリになってくれた。\nありがたいな……みんな、よろしく頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（没想到大家都这么来劲。真是帮大忙了……大家，就拜托你们了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
